title: jumufraktiv
message: >-
  If you use this software in your research, please cite it
  using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: Si-Yang
  - family-names: Speagle
    given-names: Josh
repository-code: "https://github.com/JSiyangLi/jumufraktiv"
url: "https://jsiyangli.github.io/jumufraktiv/"
abstract: >-
  A Python package for Bayesian inference in the
  MGF-marginalisable family. It computes model evidence,
  posterior densities, posterior predictive densities,
  posterior moment-generating functions and posterior moments
  by evaluating fractional derivatives of the prior
  moment-generating function.
keywords:
  - Bayesian inference
  - moment-generating function
  - fractional derivative
  - marginal likelihood
  - posterior
